  steps:
    - >-
      Implement target exactly: Market x commodity-variety-grade x issue day; 1 if any
      of next 16 calendar days has modal price >=1.25 times median of prior 28 observed
      days. Require >=20 prior observations and >=8 future observed days; otherwise
      label null. S22/S23.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      Locate existing files, verify Karnataka coverage and licences. If only Kerala data
      exists, obtain real Kolar data before KA model; do not relabel Kerala markets.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Train 2021-01-01..2023-12-31; tune
      2024-01-01..2024-06-30; calibrate 2024-07-01..2024-12-31; locked test
      2025-01-01..2026-05-31. Rolling origins every quarter in 2023-2024; purge 16 days
      plus label publication delay. Hold out markets by district within folds. If
      evidence gate fails, write blocked evidence and stop this model branch; remaining
      model tasks only test disabled state.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_features.py -q"
  acceptance:
