  phase: "P2"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on:
    - "T047"
    - "T006"
  files:
    - "src/atlas/ingest/s03.py"
    - "schemas/s03.json"
    - "tests/sources/test_s03.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Implement fetch(ctx)->list[RawArtifact] and parse(raw,config)->pyarrow.Table for
      JSON; use exact field map from discovery. Canonical fields in section7.
    - >-
      Apply schedule Daily, profile weather, deduplication/versioning and units in
      section6. Record unsupported fields as null with reasons.
    - >-
      Test real permitted sample, malformed copy, empty response and changed columns.
      Blocked source implements only disabled adapter returning SourceUnavailable, with
      no fabricated sample.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/sources/test_s03.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/sources/test_s03.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Enabled source roundtrip preserves units, IDs and source timestamps; blocked
      source fails closed and produces zero public records.
  hours: 3
- id: T049
  title: "Verify access, units and licence: Open-Meteo CAMS air-quality estimates"
  phase: "P2"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on:
    - "T007"
  files:
    - "configs/sources/s04.yaml"
    - "docs/sources/s04.md"
    - "tests/fixtures/s04/manifest.json"
    - "tests/sources/test_s04_discovery.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Use https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com; resolve only links actually published
      by the source. Record URL, access time, licence text, sample format, provider
      quota and earliest/latest date.
    - >-
      Apply source-specific check: Pollutants >=0; never label CAMS a CPCB observation;
      preserve issue and valid times.
    - >-
      Write outcome available/blocked with evidence, upstream-to-canonical field map and
      no-card status. If blocked, disable dependents and record retry condition, never
      invent endpoints or data. Bound discovery to 2 hours.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/sources/test_s04_discovery.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/sources/test_s04_discovery.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Discovery contract passes only with cited evidence and explicit
      access/licence/history status; blocked is a discovery result, not data or feature
      completion.
  hours: 2
