data/cache/atlas.duckdb
models/artifacts/{model}/{run_id}/
reports/quality/{date}.json
mlruns/  (local SQLite/artifact store; not public)
```

# 5. Tools and versions

Candidate exact pins below were resolved from official PyPI/npm metadata on4 Nov2026. This is a version-existence check, not a claim that the whole environment has been installed or compatibility-tested. T002 and the dependency-lock task compile and smoke-test Windows/Linux locks; an incompatible pin requires an exact documented replacement and re-run, never an unbounded latest install.

| Runtime / format | Pin | Reason / rejected alternative |
|---|---|---|
| Tippecanoe Linux tiler | 2.79.0 | Build from verified release tag in CI; reject always-on tile server. https://github.com/felt/tippecanoe/releases/tag/2.79.0 |
| Python Windows x64 | 3.12.10 | Official3.12 Windows installer line; py -3.12 venv. Reject installed3.14 for this project. |
| Node.js / npm | 22.16.0 / 10.9.2 | Meets current Vite/Vitest>=22.12 floor. Reject unpinned Node latest; verify Windows10 execution in environment task. |
| Parquet / GeoParquet | Parquet2.6 writer; GeoParquet1.1.0 | Typed compressed files; reject CSV as canonical truth. |
| PMTiles / MVT | PMTiles archive3; MVT2.1 | HTTP range access; reject always-on tile server. |
| GitHub Actions runner | ubuntu-24.04; windows-latest only test matrix | Standard public runners; reject paid larger runners. Workflow actions pinned to verified commits when implemented. |
| Data/experiment versioning | Git + SHA256 manifests + HF commits; MLflow local | Reject DVC for v1: no need for another remote protocol; preserve immutable hashes and lineage. |

