Constraints: probabilities in[0,1]; p10<=point<=p90 where quantiles exist; issue_at<target_end; all feature available_at<=issue_at; evaluation n_units>0 or metric null; archived manifest hash must match bytes. Operational-only local watch data never enters public datasets. Background push identifiers are not part of the enabled schema.

# 8. Feature catalogue

MVP = first Karnataka demonstration; v1 = substantive state-specific delivery; stretch = only after the shared platform and data/evidence gates. A tier is priority, not proof of availability. Conditional features stay listed with their blocker. All states inherit shared UI; a state shows only supported sources.

| ID | Feature | States | Tier | Depends on / task |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| F001 | Live state map with freshness labels | ALL | MVP | S01/S09/S17; T039 |
| F002 | Radius filter and nearby list | ALL | MVP | Versioned places, geodesic distance; T040 |
| F003 | Time slider and replay | ALL | v1 | Immutable snapshots; reconstructed mode separate; T142 |
| F004 | 3D terrain | ALL | stretch | S14, WebGL capability; T186 |
| F005 | Globe view | ALL | stretch | MapLibre globe;2D fallback; T186 |
| F006 | Wall mode | ALL | stretch | Reduced motion and pausable ticker; T186 |
| F007 | Feed health badges | ALL | MVP | Freshness/source manifest; T039 |
| F008 | Event log and ticker | ALL | MVP | S09/events; revisions and expiry; T039 |
| F009 | Daily satellite image layer | ALL | stretch | S13 available-date metadata; T186 |
| F010 | Satellites overhead | ALL | stretch | S12 orbital elements and SGP4; T187 |
| F011 | Transit stations and scheduled positions | KA/KL | v1 | S30; KL schedules only if independently verified; T104 |
| F012 | Live buses | DL | v1 | S38 approval and Worker feasibility; T165 |
| F013 | Historical train routes/stations | ALL | stretch | S21 old-data warning; T104 |
| F014 | Flights and optional coastal ships | ALL/KL | stretch | S10/S11/S26 quotas; T187 |
| F015 | Fire hotspots | ALL | v1 | S25 MAP_KEY; T105 |
| F016 | Sachet alerts including provider-issued lightning | ALL | MVP | S09; do not infer lightning from rain; T039 |
| F017 | News-derived preliminary event pins | KL then ALL | stretch | S41, M18, human review; T211 |
| F018 | Flood-exposed roads | KA/KL | v1 | S18 and approved exposure layer; T143 |
