### N1 neural architecture and training budget

| Item | Exact design |
|---|---|
| Architecture / tensor | Input Bx3x256x256 -> [Conv3x3/ReLU x2, channels32] -> maxpool ->64 ->128 ->256 -> bottleneck512 -> transpose-conv upsample256/128/64/32 with skip concatenations ->1x1 conv1 -> sigmoid. GroupNorm8 groups; dropout0.1 at bottleneck. |
| Training | Loss0.5*BCEWithLogits +0.5*soft Dice (valid pixels only); AdamW lr0.001 weight_decay0.0001; cosine decay; batch8 with mixed precision; max40 epochs; patience7 validation event IoU; gradient clip1.0. |
| Resource estimate | Estimated4-6GB GPU; 1-3h for <=10000 patches on T4-class GPU, measure first epoch and stop/resume at2h; patch counts and GPU type logged. |
| Export / inference | Save state_dict as safetensors plus config; optional ONNX opset17 after numerical parity<=1e-4; tile halo32px and feather overlaps. |

