### T004 - Fetch boundary and immutable raw ledger

Phase P0 | State KA | Depends on T003 | Estimate 3 hours

Files: src/atlas/ingest/http.py; src/atlas/ingest/raw_store.py; src/atlas/ingest/base.py; tests/test_http.py

1. Implement fetch_bytes(ctx,url)->RawArtifact with allowlisted hosts, timeout30s, max3 retries2/8/30s+jitter, Retry-After and conditional GET.

2. SHA256 content-address every artifact; record fetched_at, provider-issued time separately, HTTP metadata without credentials. Atomic write temp then rename.

3. Implement offline fixture replay, max-byte limit, redirect allowlist and circuit breaker after3 consecutive failures.

```
.\.venv\Scripts\python -m pytest tests/test_http.py -q
```

Acceptance command: .\.venv\Scripts\python -m pytest tests/test_http.py -q

Expected result: 304 makes no duplicate;429 waits per header; interrupted write leaves prior data intact; secrets absent from logs.

### T005 - Schema registry and available-at-time joins

Phase P0 | State KA | Depends on T004 | Estimate 3 hours

Files: src/atlas/data/validate.py; src/atlas/data/asof.py; schemas/common.json; tests/test_asof.py

