- id: T001
  title: "Create repository and planning contract"
  phase: "P0"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on: []
  files:
    - "README.md"
    - "AGENTS.md"
    - ".gitignore"
    - "LICENSE"
    - "docs/plan.pdf"
    - "docs/decisions.md"
  steps:
    - >-
      Create a new folder named monsoon-atlas; run git init. Preserve existing unrelated
      repositories.
    - >-
      Copy this PDF to docs/plan.pdf; record Karnataka -> Kerala -> Delhi, Rs0/no-card,
      real data, Python3.12 and DuckDB1.x constraints in AGENTS.md.
    - >-
      Use MIT for original code only; dataset licences remain separate. Ignore .env,
      .venv, data/raw, data/clean, secrets and mlruns.
  commands:
    - "git init"
    - "git check-ignore .env"
    - "git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree"
  acceptance:
    command: "git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree; git check-ignore .env"
    expected: >-
      git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree prints true; required files exist; .env is
      ignored.
  hours: 1
- id: T002
  title: "Python 3.12 environment, linting and tests"
  phase: "P0"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on:
    - "T001"
  files:
    - "pyproject.toml"
    - "requirements/core.in"
    - "requirements/core.txt"
    - "requirements/dev.in"
    - "requirements/dev.txt"
    - "src/atlas/__init__.py"
    - "tests/test_environment.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Install official Python3.12.10 x64 if absent; py -3.12 must resolve3.12,
      never3.14. Create venv.
    - >-
      Pin core: duckdb/httpx/pydantic/typer/PyYAML/pyarrow/pandas/numpy; dev:
      pytest/pytest-cov/ruff/pip-tools. Use section5 pins and compile hash locks on
      Windows.
    - >-
      Test Python major/minor, DuckDB major1, Parquet roundtrip and DB reopen integrity.
      Expose package with editable install. If pins conflict, test a compatible exact
      patch and record lock/ADR; no blind upgrades.
  commands:
    - "py -3.12 -m venv .venv"
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pip install pip-tools==7.6.2"
