- id: T035
  title: "Labels and features: Kolar tomato and cross-state price-spike warning"
  phase: "P1"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on:
    - "T034"
    - "T024"
    - "T026"
    - "T012"
  files:
    - "configs/models/m06.yaml"
    - "src/atlas/features/m06.py"
    - "tests/models/test_m06_features.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Implement target exactly: Market x commodity-variety-grade x issue day; 1 if any
      of next 16 calendar days has modal price >=1.25 times median of prior 28 observed
      days. Require >=20 prior observations and >=8 future observed days; otherwise
      label null. S22/S23.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      Locate existing files, verify Karnataka coverage and licences. If only Kerala data
      exists, obtain real Kolar data before KA model; do not relabel Kerala markets.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Train 2021-01-01..2023-12-31; tune
      2024-01-01..2024-06-30; calibrate 2024-07-01..2024-12-31; locked test
      2025-01-01..2026-05-31. Rolling origins every quarter in 2023-2024; purge 16 days
      plus label publication delay. Hold out markets by district within folds. If
      evidence gate fails, write blocked evidence and stop this model branch; remaining
      model tasks only test disabled state.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_features.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_features.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Target and lag assertions pass on real labelled fixture; future-data mutation
      rejected; blocked model exports no prediction.
  hours: 3
- id: T036
  title: "Baseline and bounded candidate: Kolar tomato and cross-state price-spike warning"
  phase: "P1"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on:
    - "T035"
  files:
    - "src/atlas/models/m06.py"
    - "notebooks/models/m06.ipynb"
    - "tests/models/test_m06_fit.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Fit baseline: Training market-season prevalence; logistic regression on last price
      change; seasonal-naive price forecast converted to threshold. Save predictions on
      identical fold rows.
    - >-
      Fit candidate: Logistic regression and LightGBM classifier; provisional LightGBM.
      Reuse existing project only after matching label and split definitions. Use
      section11 search space and maximum30 CPU trials/2h; neural jobs use explicit
      N-card and resume checkpoints.
    - >-
      Save MLflow run, preprocessing, weights and split hashes; training function
      receives only train/tune data, never test. If blocked, preserve no-model manifest.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_fit.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_fit.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Deterministic train smoke test passes; test rows cannot affect fit; all evaluated
      baselines have same target units and rows.
  hours: 3
- id: T037
  title: "Evaluate and publish decision: Kolar tomato and cross-state price-spike warning"
  phase: "P1"
  state: "KA"
  depends_on:
    - "T036"
  files:
    - "reports/models/m06.md"
    - "models/registry/m06.json"
    - "tests/models/test_m06_gate.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Evaluate locked test once; report PR-AUC >=1.25x prevalence and > baseline by
      paired CI; recall at precision>=0.25; Brier <=0.95x baseline; report F1/ROC-AUC.
      Existing PR-AUC 0.33 is background, not a promised result.
    - >-
      Inspect failure modes: Market closures, inconsistent units, reporting delays and
      product substitution; no trading or price guarantee. Include source coverage,
      intervals, sliced performance and limits; block non-supported claims.
    - >-
      Export champion predictions/SHAP/intervals only if all gates pass; else publish
      baseline/research-only status. Save model card and retraining rule.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_gate.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m06_gate.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Release manifest verifies source/split hashes and gate decision; failing model
      remains disabled; report never substitutes targets for achieved scores.
  hours: 3
