      from registry, so weather fetches only every6h and alerts every15min. Max job3min;
      concurrency1; no overlap.
    - >-
      Upload each changed normalized snapshot to authenticated hot endpoint; frontend
      polls alerts at15min while active and weather at6h. On hot endpoint failure show
      dated daily static fallback.
    - >-
      Conditional GET/idempotency, quota stops and disabled-source skip; jobs may delay,
      so UI uses actual observed/fetched times, not guaranteed live latency.
