    - >-
      Inspect failure modes: Ungauged inflows, release policy changes, missing spill
      measurements; extreme peaks outside historical support. Include source coverage,
      intervals, sliced performance and limits; block non-supported claims.
    - >-
      Export champion predictions/SHAP/intervals only if all gates pass; else publish
