      gauge-day. This is same-day reconstruction after neighbouring gauges report, not a
      forecast. Labels S27/S29.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      >=30 gauges, >=3 years, coordinates and station move history. Simulated
      missingness masks real measurements; no synthetic values used as ground truth.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Train 2017-01-01..2021-12-31; tune Jan-Jun 2022;
      calibrate Jul-Dec 2022; test 2023. Hold out 20% of station spatial blocks
      deterministically by district/geometry, plus contiguous 7-day outages. If evidence
      gate fails, write blocked evidence and stop this model branch; remaining model
      tasks only test disabled state.
