      Implement target exactly: 100m terrain cell; relative susceptibility to mapped
      slope failure, not a daily probability or trigger warning. Inventory S37, absence
      sampling only in surveyed footprint.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      >=200 independent landslides with positional error <=100m and survey footprint;
      absence label sensitivity at 1:1/1:5/1:10 sampled controls.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Train dated events through 2016; tune 2017; locked
      test 2018. If only 2018 inventory exists: 5 spatial catchment-block folds within
      2018, report spatial validation only and no temporal-generalization claim. If
      evidence gate fails, write blocked evidence and stop this model branch; remaining
      model tasks only test disabled state.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m09_features.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m09_features.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Target and lag assertions pass on real labelled fixture; future-data mutation
      rejected; blocked model exports no prediction.
  hours: 3
