- id: T138
  title: "Evaluate and publish decision: Kerala landslide susceptibility"
  phase: "P3"
  state: "KL"
  depends_on:
    - "T137"
  files:
    - "reports/models/m09.md"
    - "models/registry/m09.json"
    - "tests/models/test_m09_gate.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Evaluate locked test once; report PR-AUC >=1.20x same-sampling baseline; ROC-AUC
      secondary; recall at top 10% mapped area; bootstrap by event and spatial block.
    - >-
      Inspect failure modes: Survey bias and positional uncertainty; recalibration
      cannot turn presence-background scores into absolute risk. Include source
      coverage, intervals, sliced performance and limits; block non-supported claims.
    - >-
      Export champion predictions/SHAP/intervals only if all gates pass; else publish
      baseline/research-only status. Save model card and retraining rule.
