    - "tests/models/test_m10_features.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Implement target exactly: Market-commodity weekly log modal price response over
      weeks0..4 after local rain exceeds training calendar-week 95th percentile.
      Estimand is conditional association unless identification assumptions hold.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      >=30 markets and >=50 independent heavy-rain events; pre-trends, overlap and
      spillovers audited. Granger test is not proof of causation.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Train 2021-01-01..2023-12-31; tune
      2024-01-01..2024-06-30; calibrate 2024-07-01..2024-12-31; locked test
      2025-01-01..2026-05-31. Rolling origins every quarter in 2023-2024; purge 28 days
      plus label publication delay. Hold out markets by district within folds. Keep all
      outcomes from one rain event in the same fold. If evidence gate fails, write
      blocked evidence and stop this model branch; remaining model tasks only test
      disabled state.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m10_features.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m10_features.py -q"
