    - "reports/models/m17.md"
    - "models/registry/m17.json"
    - "tests/models/test_m17_gate.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Evaluate locked test once; report Event-macro IoU >=baseline+0.05 with positive95%
      event bootstrap difference; Dice/F1, omission/commission; boundary error;
      calibrated confidence if used.
    - >-
      Inspect failure modes: Radar shadow, vegetation and urban double bounce; tiling
      leakage; permanent water confusion. Include source coverage, intervals, sliced
      performance and limits; block non-supported claims.
    - >-
      Export champion predictions/SHAP/intervals only if all gates pass; else publish
      baseline/research-only status. Save model card and retraining rule.
