    - >-
      Implement target exactly: For a chosen place and issue time, recompute the
      already-approved flood score under 0.5x/1.0x/1.5x observed input rain; show delta
      relative to original. This is model sensitivity, not causal intervention or
      hydrodynamic flood depth.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      Approved flood model and consistent feature recomputation; otherwise disable
      controls.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: No new train/test split; inherits approved base-model
      test and runs on held-out cases only for illustration. If evidence gate fails,
      write blocked evidence and stop this model branch; remaining model tasks only test
      disabled state.
