- id: T209
  title: "Labels and features: Malayalam/English news event extraction"
  phase: "P5"
  state: "KL"
  depends_on:
    - "T034"
    - "T129"
    - "T166"
    - "T189"
    - "T190"
    - "T191"
    - "T192"
    - "T193"
    - "T194"
    - "T195"
    - "T196"
    - "T197"
    - "T198"
    - "T199"
    - "T200"
    - "T201"
    - "T202"
    - "T203"
    - "T204"
    - "T205"
    - "T206"
    - "T207"
    - "T208"
    - "T126"
  files:
    - "configs/models/m18.yaml"
    - "src/atlas/features/m18.py"
    - "tests/models/test_m18_features.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Implement target exactly: Permitted article ->
      flood/landslide/fire/transport/other, event date and public place mention; labels
      manually annotated, pins preliminary and human-reviewed. No personal entity
      extraction.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      >=1000 permitted annotated texts, >=100/class across >=2 publishers and both
      languages; test never augmented from training translations.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Canonical prospective study: collect from 2027-10-18;
      train 2027-10-18..2027-12-16; tune 2027-12-17..2028-01-15; calibrate
      2028-01-16..2028-01-30; locked test 2028-01-31..2028-02-14. Publisher-held-out
      temporal evaluation; remove syndicated duplicates; no training translations of
      test articles. Dates assume source approval/readiness tasks pass on schedule. If
      delayed, shift the entire manifest before training; never invent earlier
      observations. If evidence gate fails, write blocked evidence and stop this model
      branch; remaining model tasks only test disabled state.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m18_features.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m18_features.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Target and lag assertions pass on real labelled fixture; future-data mutation
      rejected; blocked model exports no prediction.
  hours: 3
- id: T210
  title: "Baseline and bounded candidate: Malayalam/English news event extraction"
  phase: "P5"
  state: "KL"
  depends_on:
    - "T209"
  files:
    - "src/atlas/models/m18.py"
    - "notebooks/models/m18.ipynb"
    - "tests/models/test_m18_fit.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Fit baseline: Keyword rules + gazetteer; TF-IDF logistic classifier. Save
      predictions on identical fold rows.
    - >-
      Fit candidate: Frozen multilingual-e5 embeddings + logistic first; optional MuRIL
      classifier N2 only after licence/model compatibility gate. Use section11 search
      space and maximum30 CPU trials/2h; neural jobs use explicit N-card and resume
      checkpoints.
    - >-
      Save MLflow run, preprocessing, weights and split hashes; training function
      receives only train/tune data, never test. If blocked, preserve no-model manifest.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m18_fit.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m18_fit.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Deterministic train smoke test passes; test rows cannot affect fit; all evaluated
      baselines have same target units and rows.
  hours: 3
- id: T211
  title: "Evaluate and publish decision: Malayalam/English news event extraction"
  phase: "P5"
  state: "KL"
  depends_on:
    - "T210"
  files:
    - "reports/models/m18.md"
    - "models/registry/m18.json"
    - "tests/models/test_m18_gate.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Evaluate locked test once; report Event macro-F1>=baseline+0.05; place
      precision>=0.90; event date exact-match>=0.90; pin precision>=0.95 after review;
      document-block95% CI.
    - >-
      Inspect failure modes: Ambiguous place names, historical mentions, satire, copied
      alerts and language imbalance; do not treat news allegations as verified
      incidents. Include source coverage, intervals, sliced performance and limits;
      block non-supported claims.
    - >-
      Export champion predictions/SHAP/intervals only if all gates pass; else publish
      baseline/research-only status. Save model card and retraining rule.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m18_gate.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m18_gate.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Release manifest verifies source/split hashes and gate decision; failing model
      remains disabled; report never substitutes targets for achieved scores.
  hours: 3
