- id: T214
  title: "Labels and features: Cross-state sensor and market anomalies"
  phase: "P5"
  state: "ALL"
  depends_on:
    - "T034"
    - "T166"
    - "T212"
    - "T213"
    - "T024"
  files:
    - "configs/models/m16.yaml"
    - "src/atlas/features/m16.py"
    - "tests/models/test_m16_features.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Implement target exactly: Feed-entity x report time; unusual residual relative to
      trailing28-day median and MAD, corrected for season/hour. Flag abs(robust_z)>4, or
      impossible unit bounds; anomaly != real-world incident.
    - >-
      Build feature table and feature provenance list from section11. Enforce data gate:
      Manual labels from real archived records; if fewer100 labels report counts and
      intervals, no quality claim.
    - >-
      Write dated split manifest: Price/rain historical train2021-2023; tune first
      half2024; test2025. New feeds: first30d calibration, next30d manual evaluation. No
      random time split. If evidence gate fails, write blocked evidence and stop this
      model branch; remaining model tasks only test disabled state.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m16_features.py -q"
  acceptance:
    command: ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m16_features.py -q"
    expected: >-
      Target and lag assertions pass on real labelled fixture; future-data mutation
      rejected; blocked model exports no prediction.
  hours: 3
- id: T215
  title: "Baseline and bounded candidate: Cross-state sensor and market anomalies"
  phase: "P5"
  state: "ALL"
  depends_on:
    - "T214"
  files:
    - "src/atlas/models/m16.py"
    - "notebooks/models/m16.ipynb"
    - "tests/models/test_m16_fit.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Fit baseline: Range checks and seasonal robust-z rules. Save predictions on
      identical fold rows.
    - >-
      Fit candidate: Robust z default; IsolationForest challenger on residual features;
      no autoencoder required. Use section11 search space and maximum30 CPU trials/2h;
      neural jobs use explicit N-card and resume checkpoints.
    - >-
      Save MLflow run, preprocessing, weights and split hashes; training function
      receives only train/tune data, never test. If blocked, preserve no-model manifest.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m16_fit.py -q"
