- id: T216
  title: "Evaluate and publish decision: Cross-state sensor and market anomalies"
  phase: "P5"
  state: "ALL"
  depends_on:
    - "T215"
  files:
    - "reports/models/m16.md"
    - "models/registry/m16.json"
    - "tests/models/test_m16_gate.py"
  steps:
    - >-
      Evaluate locked test once; report Precision>=0.80 among 100 adjudicated flags, <=1
      false alert/entity-week; recall measured only on independently known anomalies;
      Wilson CI and day-block CI.
    - >-
      Inspect failure modes: True floods look like outliers: never delete solely because
      anomalous; missing or revised readings can trigger false alerts. Include source
      coverage, intervals, sliced performance and limits; block non-supported claims.
    - >-
      Export champion predictions/SHAP/intervals only if all gates pass; else publish
      baseline/research-only status. Save model card and retraining rule.
  commands:
    - ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests/models/test_m16_gate.py -q"
