# 20. Appendix B: open questions and UNVERIFIED items

No further owner answers are required to use this plan. The owner asked to proceed with assumptions. The items below are executable verification gates; they are not silently resolved by assumptions. UNKNOWN/UNVERIFIED always has an owner task, evidence requirement and fallback.

| Item | Required evidence / resolution | Owner task / fallback |
|---|---|---|
| Laptop/available hours | Measure RAM/disk/CPU and verify Windows3.12 environment; planning assumption8GB/60GB/10h-week. | T002; lower concurrency/AOI or revise schedule without buying hardware. |
| Name availability | Check chosen free pages.dev subdomain and public trademark/name conflicts before branding. | T001; select another proposed original name, no paid domain. |
| Existing price repository/data | Locate real files; hash inputs; check licence, Karnataka coverage and original label/evaluation code. | T023; official export discovery, no invented records. |
| KWRIS daily history/inflow | Earliest/latest daily observations, units/datum, outflow/inflow and redistribution rights. | T008; levels-only display; inflow and daily models blocked. |
| KSEB archive depth | Actual monthly files and availability of daily historical labels. | T115; monthly EDA and future daily collection. |
| Ward/taluk IDs and institutional shelters | Exact official boundaries/release and current public shelter records. | T030 / T085; district/H3 exploration, no guaranteed routing. |
| Kerala2018 labels and landslide inventory | Exact dataset/publication link, licence, geography, occurrence dates, survey coverage and pre-event negatives. | T119 / T123; descriptive replay, no unsupported predictive metric. |
| Sentinel-1 / NDVI products | Free access, actual product IDs, scene licences, processing and independent masks. Quantitative NDVI cannot be read from decorative true-colour tiles. | T127; skip U-Net/crop layer until data supported. |
| News RSS permission | Exact publishers/feed URLs and usable permitted text; annotation consent not needed for personal data because personal records are excluded. | T125; no news pins; official CAP remains. |
| Crime source | Accessible licensed district totals with year/geography definitions. | T087; disabled layer, no scraped individual cases. |
| Delhi OTD | Free registration approval, exact feed schema, trip linkage, quotas and redistribution rights. | T148; static GTFS and no ETA claims. |
| CPCB history/CAMS vintages | Actual pollutant concentration windows and matched past forecast issue records. | T159; observational dashboard and prospective collection. |
| Live Worker feasibility | Measured CPU/memory/protobuf body size and D1 write/read/storage usage on actual Delhi sample. | T152; owner-run/active-view collection with narrower claims. |
| All source licences / quotas | Per-source exact permissions and attribution; source tested live does not establish open licence. | Every discover_Sxx task; link-only metadata or disabled ingestion as terms require. |
| Hugging Face public storage | Account upload/range/CORS/rate tests; best-effort public allocation accepted. | T045; local archive and smaller static public releases. |
| LLM free-model availability | No-card Workers AI probe, actual neuron charges, multilingual response/eval; model identifier may retire. | T180 / T181; cited extractive search. |
| Web Push/privacy conflict | Strict no-personal-data and retained subscription identifiers cannot both hold for server push. | T184; remain disabled until explicit future policy revision. |
| Continuous archive forever | Finite storage cannot retain an unbounded stream forever for free. | T006; preserve history and pause ingestion at cap. |
| India-WRIS SSL/browser | Optional browser access test with normal certificate checks; no dependency on successful result. | T008; continue KWRIS-only plan and record blocker. |
| Other failed sources | Kochi Metro timeout; Kerala RERA503; NCRB/CGWB failure; ASDMA404; BiharFMISC gone; GDELT429. No required dependency. | Corresponding discovery evidence may be updated if a real official replacement appears; otherwise source stays excluded. No speculative URL. |
| Kaggle GPU and local weights | Account-specific GPU quota, eligibility and download licence; no guaranteed30-hour allowance assumed. | T174 / T168; free Colab when available, CPU baselines otherwise. |
| Package integrated compatibility | Candidate exact versions verified only for existence; Windows/Linux wheels, lock resolution and actual API imports still need testing. | T007; tested exact replacement documented in decision log. |
| India mapping/publication conditions | Record applicable official boundary/attribution/publication guidance before public map release; do not guess legal compliance. | T046; withhold disputed/unreviewed layers until checked. |
| AI-agent effort overrun | If any task exceeds3h, record child task with exact files/tests and dependency; keep numbered/YAML representations synchronized. | Current task owner; no silent scope expansion or claim of completion. |

### Source and verification notes

Planning inputs read:3-chatgpt-prompt.txt (governing request),1-handoff.pdf (2 pages) and2-project-overview.pdf (3 pages). The conversion script md2pdf.py was ignored. Source-status claims from those documents are labelled as handoff evidence. No project repository, provider account, model training or live deployment was created in this planning task.

Online checks were limited to dependencies, platform limits and supporting terms needed to make the plan concrete, rather than re-running the supplied source reconnaissance. Official URLs appear next to claims in sections4-6,12-14. Version metadata came from https://pypi.org/pypi/{package}/json and https://registry.npmjs.org/{package}/latest; lock-task evidence supersedes these candidate pins if compatibility requires a documented change.

